#    - 64x64 (Multiple M/N blocks, full ZMM vectors, page boundary check)
#    - 33x23 (Multi-block + N-tail + M-tail)
#    - 64x1  (GEMV n1 path where vectorization axis can flip to M)
#    - 1x64  (GEMV m1 path)
